WEBVTT

NOTE Generated by HOOKLINE — positioned for vertical safe area.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.722 line:82% align:center
We worked genuinely
unreasonable hours for

00:00:02.722 --> 00:00:03.600 line:82% align:center
the first year.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.842 line:82% align:center
I would not recommend
it and I do not

00:00:06.842 --> 00:00:08.800 line:82% align:center
think it was necessary.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.749 line:82% align:center
The parts of the
product that came out of

00:00:11.749 --> 00:00:14.840 line:82% align:center
those hours are, almost
without exception,

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.800 line:82% align:center
the parts we
later deleted.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:20.279 line:82% align:center
The parts that
survived were built in

00:00:20.279 --> 00:00:22.425 line:82% align:center
year two, at
a normal pace,

00:00:22.425 --> 00:00:24.350 line:82% align:center
by people who had slept.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.750 line:82% align:center
Make of that
what you will.
